Today is Saturday morning.
I am walking to a small café.
It is a community café.
There is a light rain outside now.
I am walking holding my umbrella.
June is the monsoon season in Kochi.
I have visited this café many times before.
But today is my first day there as a volunteer.
I decided to work there every Saturday morning.
I wanted to meet new people.
I also want to know this city better.
I always like to learn new things.
I have never worked in a café before.
I am a software engineer.
Therefore, I am a little nervous.
Still, I am excited about this new experience.
The café is in front of me now.
I stepped out of the rain and closed my umbrella.
Then I stepped inside with a big smile.
